      "id": "inspired-product-s075-p00438",
      "source_en": "T he OKR system is very scalable. I would argue some sort of tool for managing and aligning work is critical to scaling effectively, but it’s also true that many companies do struggle with scaling their use of OKRs. In this chapter, I shine a light on what needs to change as you use the OKR system at scale. Remember that I’m just talking about the product and technology organization here (product management, user experience design, and engineering), and while you can use the techniques I’m about to describe at any scale, I am focused here on growth stage or enterprise organizations.",
